\* Revision-5.1 main cfg. Expected GREEN on P1-P3, P5 and P5_Spread.
\* Bounds: N = 2, B = declared + 1, OpPeriod = 2, PollInterval = 1 so Expected
\* = 2 failed polls (Allowance 0); one poll per time unit (MaxPollsPerTick 1);
\* MaxFaults = 1; MaxTime = 6 (attempt 1 can end EVIDENCE_UNAVAILABLE at 4,
\* attempt 2 can then latch, ship, expire or be discarded).
CONSTANTS
  N = 2
  Delta = 0
